boxes-and-lines Plausible stack
// From: lib/plausible/application.ex:43-47 (five repos), lib/plausible_web/router.ex:305,414,433, tracker/src/config.js:15, assets/js/dashboard/api.ts:168,
// lib/plausible/ingestion/event.ex:137, lib/plausible/session/cache_store.ex:16, lib/plausible/stats/query_runner.ex:37, config/runtime.exs:932-947
tag Layer as l
  Client blue
  Phoenix web teal
  Elixir core green
  Storage purple
  Third party gray
active-tag Layer

[Browser]
  Tracker script l: Client
  Dashboard React l: Client
[Phoenix web]
  ExternalController l: Phoenix web
  StatsController l: Phoenix web
  PaddleClassicController l: Phoenix web
  LiveViews l: Phoenix web
[Elixir core]
  Ingestion pipeline l: Elixir core
  Session CacheStore l: Elixir core
  Write buffers l: Elixir core
  QueryRunner l: Elixir core
  Oban workers l: Elixir core
[Storage]
  Postgres l: Storage
  ClickHouse l: Storage
[Third parties]
  Paddle l: Third party
  Google GA4 l: Third party
  Mail provider l: Third party

Tracker script -POST /api/event-> ExternalController
ExternalController -> Ingestion pipeline
Ingestion pipeline -> Session CacheStore
Session CacheStore -> Write buffers
Write buffers -batched insert-> ClickHouse
Dashboard React -POST /api/stats/:domain/query-> StatsController
StatsController -> QueryRunner
QueryRunner -SQL-> ClickHouse
LiveViews -Ecto-> Postgres
Paddle -webhook-> PaddleClassicController
PaddleClassicController -> Postgres
Oban workers -job queue-> Postgres
Oban workers -import rows-> ClickHouse
Oban workers -fetch reports-> Google GA4
Oban workers -send email-> Mail provider
